        <headline>High Wind Warning issued September 26 at 6:03PM EDT until September 27 at 12:00PM EDT by NWS Mount Holly NJ</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 15 to 25 mph with gusts up to 50 mph.

* WHERE...Eastern Monmouth, Atlantic Coastal Cape May, Coastal
Atlantic, and Coastal Ocean Counties.

* WHEN...Until noon EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Damaging winds will blow down trees and power lines.
Widespread power outages are expected. Travel will be difficult,
especially for high profile vehicles.
</description>
        <instruction>People are urged to secure loose objects that could be blown around
or damaged by the wind.</instruction>
